    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote": [
      {
        "@value": "The units and accuracy for UCS are not prescribed in ISRM and the conventional MPa to 3SF is adopted here. ISRM defines GPa to 3SF for Young s modulus and as such this is also adopted.\nISRM specifies stress rate MPa/s but most tests are performed at a rate of loading kN/s or kN/min, and sometimes under strain controlled conditions for deformability. The results should always be converted and reported as MPa/s where necessary.\nRUCS_E, RUCS_ESTR and RUCS_ETYP have been deprecated to allow for reporting of Young s modulus secant, tangent and average simultaneously.\nRUCS_MU has been deprecated to allow for reporting of Poisson's ratio secant, tangent and average simultaneously.",
        "@language": "en"
      }
    ],
